{"seq":1,"slug":"physical-examination","title":"大学临床医学 — 体格检查","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/diagnostics/physical-examination","wordCount":1836,"readingTime":8,"html":"<h1 id=\"大学临床医学-体格检查\">大学临床医学 — 体格检查</h1><h2 id=\"知识要点\">知识要点</h2><p>体格检查是临床诊断的第一手资料来源，通过视诊、触诊、叩诊和听诊四种基本方法获取客观体征。在影像和实验室技术高度发达的今天，体格检查仍然不可替代——它是医生与患者身体直接交流的过程，能即时提供定性和定位信息，指导后续检查的方向选择。规范的查体流程是每位临床医学生必须反复训练直至熟练的基本功。</p>\n<h2 id=\"详细讲解\">详细讲解</h2><h3 id=\"一般检查与生命体征\">一般检查与生命体征</h3><p>一般检查在正式系统查体前进行，包括：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>项目</th>\n<th>正常参考值</th>\n<th>临床意义</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>体温（T）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>36.0</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>37.0</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">36.0\\text{-}37.0°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">36.0</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">37.0°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span>（腋温）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>37.2</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 37.2°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">37.2°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 为发热，<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>39.1</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">°</mi><mi>C</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 39.1°C</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">39.1°</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0715em;\">C</span></span></span></span></span> 为高热</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>脉搏（P）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>60</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>100</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">60\\text{-}100</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">60</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">100</span></span></span></span></span> 次/min</td>\n<td>心律、脉率与心率是否一致</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>呼吸（R）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>12</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>20</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">12\\text{-}20</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">12</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span></span></span></span></span> 次/min</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>24</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 24</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">24</span></span></span></span></span> 次/min 为呼吸增快</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>血压（BP）</td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>140</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>90</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mmHg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 140/90\\,\\text{mmHg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">140/90</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mmHg</span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td>双上肢差值 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>20</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>mmHg</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt; 20\\,\\text{mmHg}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">20</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">mmHg</span></span></span></span></span></span> 提示锁骨下动脉狭窄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>S</mi><mi>p</mi><msub><mi>O</mi><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">SpO_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0576em;\">S</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:-0.0278em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>95</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>100</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">95\\text{-}100\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">95</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">100%</span></span></span></span></span></td>\n<td><span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&lt;</mo><mn>90</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">%</mi></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&lt; 90\\%</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8056em;vertical-align:-0.0556em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">90%</span></span></span></span></span> 提示呼吸衰竭</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>一般状态评估还包括：意识水平（清醒→嗜睡→昏睡→昏迷）、体位（自主体位/被动体位/强迫体位）、面容与表情（甲亢面容、库欣面容、二尖瓣面容）、营养状态（BMI）、皮肤黏膜（黄疸、紫绀、水肿、皮疹）和淋巴结。</p>\n<h3 id=\"心脏查体\">心脏查体</h3><p>心脏查体按&quot;视-触-叩-听&quot;顺序进行：</p>\n<p><strong>视诊</strong>：观察心前区有无隆起（提示长期心脏增大，如先心病）和心尖搏动位置。正常心尖搏动位于左锁骨中线与第 5 肋间交点，搏动范围 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2.0</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>2.5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2.0\\text{-}2.5\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2.0</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2.5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>。心尖搏动左下移位提示左室增大。</p>\n<p><strong>触诊</strong>：确认心尖搏动位置和强度，检查有无震颤（thrill）。震颤等同于 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>≥</mo><mn>4</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">/</mi><mn>6</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\geq 4/6</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7719em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≥</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4/6</span></span></span></span></span> 级的杂音——心尖区舒张期震颤见于二尖瓣狭窄，主动脉瓣区收缩期震颤见于主动脉瓣狭窄。</p>\n<p><strong>叩诊</strong>：叩出心脏相对浊音界。正常左界在第 5 肋间距前正中线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>7</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>9</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">7\\text{-}9\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">7</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">9</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>，右界在第 4 肋间距前正中线 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>2</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>3</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">2\\text{-}3\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>。心脏向左扩大提示左室增大（高血压、主动脉瓣关闭不全），向两侧扩大呈&quot;梨形&quot;提示二尖瓣病变伴左房增大。</p>\n<p><strong>听诊</strong>：五个标准听诊区：</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[二尖瓣区: 心尖部] --- B[肺动脉瓣区: 胸骨左缘第2肋间]&#10;    B --- C[主动脉瓣区: 胸骨右缘第2肋间]&#10;    C --- D[主动脉瓣第二听诊区: 胸骨左缘第3肋间]&#10;    D --- E[三尖瓣区: 胸骨左缘第4-5肋间]\">graph TD\n    A[二尖瓣区: 心尖部] --- B[肺动脉瓣区: 胸骨左缘第2肋间]\n    B --- C[主动脉瓣区: 胸骨右缘第2肋间]\n    C --- D[主动脉瓣第二听诊区: 胸骨左缘第3肋间]\n    D --- E[三尖瓣区: 胸骨左缘第4-5肋间]</pre><p>心脏杂音的六要素描述：<strong>时相</strong>（收缩期/舒张期/连续性）、<strong>部位</strong>（最响点）、<strong>强度</strong>（1-6/6 级）、<strong>性质</strong>（吹风样/隆隆样/机器样）、<strong>传导方向</strong>和<strong>体位/呼吸影响</strong>。</p>\n<p>常见杂音与瓣膜病变对应：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>杂音特征</th>\n<th>瓣膜病变</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>心尖区隆隆样舒张中晚期杂音</td>\n<td>二尖瓣狭窄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>心尖区吹风样全收缩期杂音→腋下传导</td>\n<td>二尖瓣关闭不全</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主动脉瓣区粗糙收缩期喷射样杂音→颈部传导</td>\n<td>主动脉瓣狭窄</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>主动脉瓣第二区叹气样舒张早期杂音</td>\n<td>主动脉瓣关闭不全</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"腹部查体\">腹部查体</h3><p>腹部查体顺序特殊：<strong>视-听-叩-触</strong>（先听后触，避免触诊改变肠鸣音）。</p>\n<p><strong>视诊</strong>：腹部外形（平坦/膨隆/舟状腹）、呼吸运动（腹膜炎时腹式呼吸减弱）、腹壁静脉曲张（门脉高压时以脐为中心向四周放射，称&quot;海蛇头&quot;征）。</p>\n<p><strong>听诊</strong>：正常肠鸣音 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>4</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">4\\text{-}5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">4</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> 次/min。肠鸣音亢进（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>&gt;</mo><mn>10</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">&gt;10</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.5782em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&gt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">10</span></span></span></span></span> 次/min，高调金属音）提示机械性肠梗阻；肠鸣音消失（持续听诊 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>5</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\text{-}5</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span></span></span></span></span> min 无声）提示麻痹性肠梗阻或弥漫性腹膜炎。</p>\n<p><strong>触诊</strong>：从非疼痛区开始，浅触诊（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>2</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\text{-}2\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">2</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>）检查腹壁紧张度和压痛，深触诊（<span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>3</mn><mtext>-</mtext><mn>5</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">3\\text{-}5\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">3</span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">-</span></span><span class=\"mord\">5</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span>）检查脏器和肿块。<strong>反跳痛</strong>（rebound tenderness）的检出方法：深压后突然松手，患者感到松手瞬间疼痛加剧，提示壁层腹膜受炎症刺激——这是急性腹膜炎的核心体征。</p>\n<p>肝脏触诊：正常肝脏在右锁骨中线肋缘下不可触及（或仅在深吸气时触及 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mn>1</mn><mtext> </mtext><mtext>cm</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">1\\,\\text{cm}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">cm</span></span></span></span></span></span> 以内）。肝大伴质硬、表面结节提示肝硬化或肝癌；肝大伴压痛提示急性肝炎或肝脓肿。</p>\n<p>Murphy 征：检查者将左手放在患者右肋缘下胆囊点，嘱深吸气时肝脏下移使发炎胆囊碰触检查者手指→患者因疼痛突然屏气——阳性提示急性胆囊炎。</p>\n<h3 id=\"神经系统查体要点\">神经系统查体要点</h3><p>神经系统查体覆盖意识、高级皮层功能、颅神经（I-XII）、运动系统（肌力/肌张力/不自主运动）、感觉系统、反射和协调运动。</p>\n<p>肌力分级（MRC 0-5 级）：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>级别</th>\n<th>描述</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>0</td>\n<td>完全瘫痪，无任何收缩</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>可见/可触及肌肉收缩，但不能产生运动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>消除重力后可完成全范围运动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>能抗重力完成全范围运动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>能抗一定阻力运动</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>正常肌力</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>病理反射中最重要的是 <strong>Babinski 征</strong>：用钝针划足底外侧从足跟向前→正常人足趾屈曲（阴性），锥体束损伤时拇趾背伸、其余四趾扇形展开（阳性）。Babinski 征阳性是上运动神经元损伤的可靠标志。</p>\n<h2 id=\"练习与思考\">练习与思考</h2><ol>\n<li>一位患者心脏听诊发现心尖区隆隆样舒张中晚期杂音，伴开瓣音。请判断最可能的瓣膜病变，并描述该患者可能同时出现的面容特征（&quot;二尖瓣面容&quot;）。</li>\n<li>急性阑尾炎患者的腹部查体中，你期望在哪个区域发现压痛和反跳痛？如果患者转为弥漫性腹膜炎，腹部查体会出现什么新的体征？</li>\n<li>一位昏迷患者（GCS 6 分），双侧瞳孔等大等圆，对光反射灵敏，四肢对疼痛刺激呈屈曲反应。请评估其运动反应评分，并判断是否需要气管插管。</li>\n<li>解释为什么腹部查体要&quot;先听后触&quot;而不是像心肺查体一样&quot;先视后触&quot;。</li>\n</ol>\n<h2 id=\"拓展阅读\">拓展阅读</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>Bates&#39; Guide to Physical Examination and History Taking</strong>：体格检查教材的&quot;金标准&quot;，每种手法配有彩色照片和视频。</li>\n<li><strong>DeGowin&#39;s Diagnostic Examination</strong>：按体征索引编排，适合在遇到异常体征时快速查阅。</li>\n<li><strong>Stanford Medicine 25</strong>（stanfordmedicine25.stanford.edu）：斯坦福大学的 25 项核心查体技能在线教学项目，附教学视频。</li>\n<li>学习建议：体格检查是&quot;手艺活&quot;，教科书只能传达知识框架，真正的掌握必须通过反复在标准化病人（SP）和真实患者身上练习来实现。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>体格检查以&quot;视-触-叩-听&quot;为基本框架，但不同系统有其特殊顺序（腹部先听后触）。心脏查体的核心输出是杂音描述——六要素缺一不可；腹部查体的核心是压痛和反跳痛的精确定位；神经系统查体的核心是肌力分级和病理反射的判读。所有体格检查结果都需要与病史结合解释——孤立的体征往往意义模糊，只有放入临床场景中才能形成有价值的诊断线索。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"大学临床医学 — 体格检查","id":"大学临床医学-体格检查"},{"level":2,"text":"知识要点","id":"知识要点"},{"level":2,"text":"详细讲解","id":"详细讲解"},{"level":3,"text":"一般检查与生命体征","id":"一般检查与生命体征"},{"level":3,"text":"心脏查体","id":"心脏查体"},{"level":3,"text":"腹部查体","id":"腹部查体"},{"level":3,"text":"神经系统查体要点","id":"神经系统查体要点"},{"level":2,"text":"练习与思考","id":"练习与思考"},{"level":2,"text":"拓展阅读","id":"拓展阅读"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"大学临床医学 — 神经外科","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/surgery/neurosurgery"},"next":{"title":"大学临床医学 — 实验室诊断","url":"/l-doc-books/education/university/medicine/clinical-medicine/diagnostics/laboratory-diagnostics"}}